d by mouth breathing. </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-bCMEPS kwYxRi pf-320_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kZkxCf cCxHyf pf-321_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="54d6ea2d-01de-4f31-8757-c8919bb53605" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>03. Are the strips safe to use?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-cafhLY iylgvI pf-323_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-gDszbG exMose pf-324_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-325_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-326_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS ckDBXz pf-327_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-3f31c757-c891-4bb5-b605-d497df29bbe4"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Yes! Muzzle Sleeping Strips are made with hypoallergenic materials that are safe for sensitive skin. Our strips are also free from harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalates, parabens, and PFAS, making them a safe choice for both adults and children.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-bCMEPS kwYxRi pf-330_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kZkxCf cCxHyf pf-331_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="c8919bb5-3605-4497-9f29-bbe440df1b8b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>04. How do I apply the strips?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-cafhLY iylgvI pf-333_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-gDszbG exMose pf-334_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-335_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-336_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS ckDBXz pf-337_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-d497df29-bbe4-40df-9b8b-07e3ec65a1f9"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Applying the strips is simple. Just peel off the backing and apply to skin. Gently press it in place to ensure it adheres securely. It’s that easy! The strips will stay in place all night without discomfort.
