</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-bCMEPS kwYxRi pf-350_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kZkxCf cCxHyf pf-351_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="a1f982a6-3a7c-44ba-b467-8fde8cc200ee" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>06. Can I use the strips if I have allergies or sensitive skin?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-cafhLY iylgvI pf-353_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-gDszbG exMose pf-354_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-355_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-356_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS ckDBXz pf-357_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-54baf467-8fde-4cc2-80ee-3b807c81aca5"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Absolutely! Muzzle Sleeping Strips are designed with sensitive skin in mind. The strips are hypoallergenic, and the breathable adhesive minimizes irritation, making them suitable for most users, even those with allergies or sensitive skin.
